xnu 0472: name the identity step that does not return

Measured 2026-11-26: with 0471 every window the worker touches is premapped
(`W4 premap bar ... cfg=... dbi=... iatu=...` plus the four AHB pages), the
link comes up, and the worker still stops without reaching `qca6490 id`. No
mapping is left in that path, so the block is a plain MMIO access.

`wifi_config_identity()` now prints `start`, `refgen done`, `aperture done`,
`iatu done`, `cfg read` and `cfg answered id=...`, each followed by a flush. A
hang is bounded by `wifi_wait()` and logs `wifi_fail`, so the last line names
the exact access instead of the function.
